    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_007_01:007_01_007:41d14104",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_007_01",
        "key": "007_01_007",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_007_01:007_01_007:41d14104",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_007_01:007_01_007:41d14104",
        "jp_sha256": "e25400c2be1fad4f208b4ae30d113c920f0d4c34ad9e3c178279cb40df64f805",
        "official_en_sha256": "e25400c2be1fad4f208b4ae30d113c920f0d4c34ad9e3c178279cb40df64f805"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、どうもお前は\r\nお調子者で緊張感が足りないところがある。\r\nそんな様子じゃ、いつか痛い目に遭うぞ。",
        "official_en": "だが、どうもお前は\r\nお調子者で緊張感が足りないところがある。\r\nそんな様子じゃ、いつか痛い目に遭うぞ。",
        "real_en": "But you're far too carefree, and you don't take things seriously enough. Keep this up, and you'll get yourself hurt someday."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
